{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/013-spokeshave-kit/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"7a931caa-4614-5099-9c97-c6ff1001db29","excerpt":"Hand tools have a special place in woodworking. There’s something about the direct connection between your hands and the wood that power tools can’t replicate…","html":"<p>Hand tools have a special place in woodworking. There’s something about the direct connection between your hands and the wood that power tools can’t replicate. When I spotted a spokeshave kit for sale at the Offerman Wood Shop, I couldn’t resist.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/c214b64aff9e547dba1f4a572a62edd0/669cd/top_view.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Top View\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/c214b64aff9e547dba1f4a572a62edd0/f058b/top_view.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c214b64aff9e547dba1f4a572a62edd0/c26ae/top_view.png 158w,\n/static/c214b64aff9e547dba1f4a572a62edd0/6bdcf/top_view.png 315w,\n/static/c214b64aff9e547dba1f4a572a62edd0/f058b/top_view.png 630w,\n/static/c214b64aff9e547dba1f4a572a62edd0/40601/top_view.png 945w,\n/static/c214b64aff9e547dba1f4a572a62edd0/78612/top_view.png 1260w,\n/static/c214b64aff9e547dba1f4a572a62edd0/669cd/top_view.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The kit came with all the brass hardware - adjustment screws, blade cap, and wear plates - but the wooden body was up to me. I chose a piece of hard maple for durability and shaped the handles to fit my grip.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/10c5e3d677e1bff51547033792a7c2d1/669cd/blade_view.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Blade View\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/10c5e3d677e1bff51547033792a7c2d1/f058b/blade_view.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/10c5e3d677e1bff51547033792a7c2d1/c26ae/blade_view.png 158w,\n/static/10c5e3d677e1bff51547033792a7c2d1/6bdcf/blade_view.png 315w,\n/static/10c5e3d677e1bff51547033792a7c2d1/f058b/blade_view.png 630w,\n/static/10c5e3d677e1bff51547033792a7c2d1/40601/blade_view.png 945w,\n/static/10c5e3d677e1bff51547033792a7c2d1/78612/blade_view.png 1260w,\n/static/10c5e3d677e1bff51547033792a7c2d1/669cd/blade_view.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The underside reveals the business end: a razor-sharp blade that shaves thin curls of wood with each pass. Spokeshaves excel at shaping curves and rounding edges - perfect for chair legs, tool handles, or any piece that needs to feel good in the hand.</p>\n<p>Building your own tools is a woodworking tradition that goes back centuries. There’s a certain pride in using a tool you made yourself, and the spokeshave has earned a permanent spot on my tool wall.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Spokeshave Kit","date":"October 15, 2018","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/012-adirondacks-round-1/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Adirondacks Round 1"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/014-spooky-ghost/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spooky Ghost"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"7a931caa-4614-5099-9c97-c6ff1001db29","previousPostId":"2f00da69-bf3d-583c-b94f-06a3c94fc0a1","nextPostId":"710d4f6c-0476-5660-8ad0-8cde26452047"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}